  /* ?? Duo badge - rectangular callout in the product information column.
        Shared by the mobile and the desktop layout.

        The badge must never wrap: the whole sentence stays on one line. Rather
        than hard-coding a size that only fits one particular wording, the
        snippet works out the largest font size that still fits from the length
        of the text and hands it over as --lc-duo-badge-fs, expressed in cqi so
        it tracks the column width. Everything else (padding, icon, gap, radius)
        is in em, so the badge keeps the proportions of the source artwork at
        any width. Shorten the text in the theme editor -> the type grows. ?? */
  .lc-duo-badge-wrap {
    container-type: inline-size;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 14px 0 0;
  }
  .lc-duo-badge {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
